# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented here.

## [Unreleased]

### Added

- Initial release of DataMigrator as a standalone .NET 8 migration utility
- `transfer-config` command for migrating ATSPM 4.3 configuration (locations, devices, approaches, detectors, routes, jurisdictions, areas, regions)
- `transfer-events` command for migrating controller event logs with hourly window processing and rerun-safe replacement
- `transfer-speed` command for migrating speed events with batch flushing and rerun-safe replacement
- `upgrade-to-5` command for orchestrating all three migration phases in sequence with skip flags
- Polly retry policies for resilient source queries
- PostgreSQL sequence reset after bulk configuration import
- Import metrics summary logged at end of speed event migration
- Release automation via GitHub Actions for Windows executable and container image
- Full documentation: usage, configuration, installation, upgrade guide, troubleshooting, and design
- Test coverage for commands, hosted services, date range utilities, location filtering, speed migration connection normalization, and rerun replacement behavior
